{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/425200-recruitment-vampire-v20-pbp-oklahoma-city-by-night","id":425200,"title":"[Recruitment] [Vampire: V20] [PbP] Oklahoma City by Night","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-02T08:03:05-08:00","id":425200,"title":"[Recruitment] [Vampire: V20] [PbP] Oklahoma City by Night","content":"<br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://okcbynight.forumotion.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Oklahoma City by Night</a></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">You can read through the &quot;About&quot; section without registering to read up on the house rules, new mechanics, and character creation. Will be using V20 edition of the rulebook. Revised Ed might get quoted on occasion as that's the rule-book that I have memorized.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">There is also a Wiki with a Cast of Characters for important NPCs. And a breakdown of important locations within the districts of the city at the <a href=\"http://okcbynight.wikia.com/wiki/OKCbyNight_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">OKC by Night Wikia</a>.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The game is set to take place in modern day Oklahoma City, one of the largest cities in America in land area but among the smallest in population. It's also stuck in the middle of a very rural setting. In Oklahoma City the Gangrel are still recognized as members of the Camarilla - despite the Clan's Exodus from it. A Gangrel Primogen still sets on the council in OKC. This is due to the large population of Gangrel both in and around OKC. There is also one of the largest Tremere Chantries and territory outside of Vienna in the south of the OKC Metro area, where the Warlock's claim domain over the entire suburb of Norman to include the University of Oklahoma. Dallas, Texas sits only a few hours drive to the South and is still firmly in the grasp of the Sabbatt causing issues from time to time. </span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The plot that I will run will be heavily focused on politics, intrigue and scheming not on combat. The intention is to introduce just enough of my plot to get people in the game and then let character driven plot and story take over. There will be no drive or desire on my part to force the players to work for a common goal. If, however, the players do form alliances then more power to them!</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Looking for about 10 players to get this thing started.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Comments, questions and concerns are all welcome.</span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5209-rinald","name":"Rinald","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}